  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Prospects-P10001526-014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Up to USD 31.3 mln long-term FMO loan (of which USD 15 mln is financed by Building Prospects and the Dutch Fund for Climate and Development) intends to finance the working capital needs for the purchases of commodities from Ukraine.  The commodities sourced from Ukraine will be stored either in Reni port in Ukraine or in-land storage facilities in Moldova before export.</narrative>
  </description>
